# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) to override. Restart `yarn dev` after changing.
#
# You normally don't need this file. Which backend the dev server talks to is chosen in
# the app itself (Settings page, or the switch on the login page) and takes effect
# immediately. These only change the defaults behind that switch.
#
# Where "live" and "local" point:
# VITE_LIVE_TARGET=https://erp.pranera.in
# VITE_LOCAL_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8001     # bench --site pranera.com serve --port=8001
#
# Which one is used until you've picked (first visit, or after clearing cookies).
# Default: live. Set to local if you'd rather never start on real data.
# VITE_DEFAULT_BACKEND=local
#
# VITE_PROXY_TARGET from earlier versions is no longer read. If you created a
# .env.local with it, delete that line.
